<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="DrugImplantThingMakeableBase">
		<defName>DI_WakeUpImplant</defName>
		<label>drug-implant (WakeUp)</label>
		<description>An implant, encoded to produce Wake-up from nutrients the user eats. The user will need to eat more to sustain themselves as a consequence. The brain requires time to neurologically adapt to the constant presence of the drug, causing complications until the brain has adapted.

Once adapted, the implant pumps a lesser dose of Wake-up into the bloodstream at all times, giving the user some of the effects of Wake-up at all times. When Wake-up is ingested by the user, the implant releases nanites that deconstruct the drug when the heart is about to give out, protecting the user at the cost of losing the high. Grants the user some of the effects of Wake-up permanently without risk of addiction, and disables the ability to get a heart attack from using Wake-up</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<RecipeDef>InstallDI_WakeUpImplant</RecipeDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/Health/HealthItem</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
			<color>(189,169,118)</color>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<MarketValue>400</MarketValue>
		</statBases>
		<costList>
			<WakeUp>10</WakeUp>
			<DI_BaseImplantPart>1</DI_BaseImplantPart>
		</costList>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
				<li>DrugLab</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisites>
				<li>WakeUpProduction</li>
			</researchPrerequisites>
		</recipeMaker>
		<thingCategories>
			<li>BodyParts</li>
		</thingCategories>
	</ThingDef>
	
